      "updated": 1781908340728,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Interview must include:\n\nFunctional requirements\n\u2022 upload, parse, index, search\n\u2022 chat/RAG over files\n\u2022 citations and preview\n\u2022 permissions and deletion\n\nNon-functional requirements\n\u2022 low-latency retrieval\n\u2022 async scalable ingestion\n\u2022 high availability\n\u2022 privacy/security\n\u2022 observability\n\nTesting\n\u2022 parser unit tests\n\u2022 E2E ingestion tests\n\u2022 ACL leakage tests\n\u2022 retrieval golden set\n\u2022 load tests",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 34,
      "containerId": "92e0dfaf",
      "originalText": "Interview must include:\n\nFunctional requirements\n\u2022 upload, parse, index, search\n\u2022 chat/RAG over files\n\u2022 citations and preview\n\u2022 permissions and deletion\n\nNon-functional requirements\n\u2022 low-latency retrieval\n\u2022 async scalable ingestion\n\u2022 high availability\n\u2022 privacy/security\n\u2022 observability\n\nTesting\n\u2022 parser unit tests\n\u2022 E2E ingestion tests\n\u2022 ACL leakage tests\n\u2022 retrieval golden set\n\u2022 load tests",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
